### Register: başarılı (201)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ali Veli", "email": "Ali@Example.com", "password": "gizli12345" }

### Register: aynı e-posta, farklı harf (409 EMAIL_TAKEN)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Baska Biri", "email": "ali@example.com", "password": "gizli12345" }

### Register: kısa şifre (400 VALIDATION_ERROR)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ayse", "email": "ayse@example.com", "password": "123" }

### Register: fazladan alan yok sayılmalı (201)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Mehmet", "email": "mehmet@example.com", "password": "gizli12345", "emailVerifiedAt": "2020-01-01" }

### Register: başarılı (201)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "ayşe demir", "email": "ayse2@example.com", "password": "gizli12345" }

### Verify: geçerli token (200)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/verify-email
Content-Type: application/json

{ "token": "b8c5156c01bf2c39e7d0640f5940a91f1e5c2e7234fd16b5fa2869cdb525a8f9" }

### Verify: aynı token tekrar (400 INVALID_TOKEN)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/verify-email
Content-Type: application/json

{ "token": "b8c5156c01bf2c39e7d0640f5940a91f1e5c2e7234fd16b5fa2869cdb525a8f9" }

### Verify: uydurma token (400 INVALID_TOKEN)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/verify-email
Content-Type: application/json

{ "token": "abc123" }

### Resend: kayıtlı olmayan e-posta (200, aynı cevap)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/resend-verification
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "yok@example.com" }

### Resend: doğrulanmamış hesap (200, konsolda yeni link)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/resend-verification
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ayse2@example.com" }